+      "kind": "StringLiteral",
+      "offset": 18376,
+      "length": 298,
+      "value": "\"Cannot convert a typed array, ArrayBuffer or DataView to a free-form native value, because free-form values hold only primitives, plain objects, arrays and dates. Convert it to an array first (for example, with Array.from), or declare the native type as JavaScriptValue to receive it unconverted.\""
